N        EQU   3
U        EQU   1000
V        EQU   1010
W        EQU   1020
         ORIG  3000
START    ENN1  N         A1. Initialize. j ← 0.
         JOV   OFLO      Ensure that overflow is off.
1H       ENTA  0         k ← 0.
         J1Z   3F        Exit the loop if j = n.
2H       ADD   U+N,1     A2. Add digits.
         ADD   V+N,1
         STA   W+N,1
         INC1  1         A3. Loop on j. j ← j + 1.
         JNOV  1B        If no overflow, set k ← 0.
         ENTA  1         Otherwise, set k ← 1.
         J1N   2B        To A2 if j < n.
3H       STA   W+N       Store final carry in wn.
         HLT
OFLO     HLT   1
         END   START
